# OtoYomi's open-source frontend requires no environment variables.
# Hosted features must be implemented on a trusted server. Never put provider
# secrets in VITE_* variables or browser code. See docs/HOSTED_FEATURES.md.

# Example server-only names (not read by the frontend):
# AUTH_SERVER_URL=https://auth.example.com
# AI_PROVIDER_API_KEY=replace-on-server-only
# DATABASE_URL=replace-on-server-only
